00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,280
I didn't have any dates.

860
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,319
In Hainan, I was at the house every day.

861
00:27:45,319 --> 00:27:47,680
Like I was filming
"The Chinese Restaurant".

862
00:27:48,199 --> 00:27:49,319
Let me take some photos of you.

863
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:50,880
Photos of me?

864
00:27:51,439 --> 00:27:51,760
Why?

865
00:27:52,119 --> 00:27:52,920
Let's take them here.

866
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,760
Just sit next to me and take them.

867
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,119
Absolutely stunning.

868
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:03,040
Let's go.

869
00:28:03,040 --> 00:28:03,280
Okay.

870
00:28:11,396 --> 00:28:12,992
Whether it works out or not,
his mother will still like you.

871
00:28:12,992 --> 00:28:13,952
Sweet.

872
00:28:14,816 --> 00:28:16,000
She's at it again.

873
00:28:18,112 --> 00:28:19,648
You two are really hilarious.

874
00:28:22,016 --> 00:28:23,872
A thousand words turn
into a finger heart.
